Roxanne II decrypting centre
Message 20365
For % &
                            General Alex Kolman
                            Saint Georges Base
                            Mount Phoenix

Welcome to OKIMURA. I hope you appreciate the comfort of
your new quarters, you'll find, the local food is excellent.
Mister Keno is your interpretor, he is an expert in protocole
and his mission is to accompany you during your trips.

Well let's get to the reasons for your presence here at
Okiruma. As you know the Psychos of Bimitz and the Paranos
of North Kuzdar have created an alliance and their troops
are already moving towards the borders of our allies the
Fanatos.

The God Emperor Nichiban is in a situation of inferiority
and hasn't waited to invoke the pact of assistance that
links our two countries, our troups are authorized to
deploy themselves along all the Lendo territory borders

You will head the detachment that is landing to the north of
the town of Kimino, the communication lines have been cut
and we are without news. The Fanato base of Anaka reported
the presence of enemy troops.

Go and see what is happening at Kimino and set up a solid
base that will enable you to overlook the region.

I count on your experience.